        <mxCell id="c293" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#6b7280;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="«record» components are shown as + read-only properties: Java gives each a private final field&lt;br&gt;and a public accessor. Getters, toString(), most constructors and most private helpers are left out.&lt;br&gt;Nested types used as member types: ArrivalSchedule.Arrival «record», ArrivalSchedule.CustomerFactory&lt;br&gt;«interface», GameResult.Target «record», Cashier.Payment «record», CommandParser.Input «record»." vertex="1">
